    "title": "<p>Immunohistochemistry panels for exclusion of primary tumours and classification of cancer of unknown primary site</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Alwin Krämer",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; mso-table-layout-alt: fixed; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" width=\"938\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.35pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"142\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Lineage/tumour classification</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.45pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Screening markers</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.5pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Further entity-specific workup</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"142\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Carcinoma</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Broad-spectrum keratin (e.g. AE1/AE3, OSCAR), CAM5.2, EMA, EpCAM (BerEP4, MOC31), claudin-4</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">See below</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"142\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Haematolymphoid</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.45pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">CD45</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">CD3, CD20, CD79a, CD30, CD138 plus additional marker</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"142\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Melanoma</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">SOX10 &gt; S100</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">S100, melan-A, HMB45, p75-NGFR (CD271), PRAME</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"142\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Sarcoma</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.45pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">No (exclusion of the other entities)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"142\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Germ cell</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">SALL4, OCT3/4 &gt; PLAP</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Seminoma: KIT, D2-40</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Embryonal carcinoma: CD30</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Yolk sac tumour: AFP, glypican-3 (GPC3)</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Trophoblastic tumours: &beta;-hCG, GATA3, inhibin, PDL1</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.35pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"142\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Mesothelioma</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.45pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Calretinin</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.5pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">WT1, D2-40, CK5/6, loss of BAP1, lack of claudin-4</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 7; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.35pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"142\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Carcinoma primary markers</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.45pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Entity</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.5pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Additional markers to consider</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 8; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.35pt; border: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"142\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>CK7+/CK20&minus;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.45pt; border: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.5pt; border: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 9; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"142\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.45pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Lung (NSCLC [adeno] and SCLC)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">TTF1, napsin&nbsp;A, SMARCA4 (BRG1), INSM1, synaptophysin</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 10; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"142\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Thyroid</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Thyroglobulin, TTF1, PAX8</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 11; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"142\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.45pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Breast</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">GATA3, SOX10, ER, PR, mammaglobin, GCDFP-15 (BRST2), ERBB2 (HER2), TRPS1</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 12; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"142\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Upper gastrointestinal&nbsp;/ pancreaticobiliary</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">CDX2, CK19, SMAD4, ARID1A, BAP1</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 13; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"142\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.45pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Colorectal with MMR deficiency (be aware)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">CDX2, SATB2, MMR proteins</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 14; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"142\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Endometrial, endocervical, ovary (serous)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span lang=\"FR\">PAX8, ER, PR, WT1, p53</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 15; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"142\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.45pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Renal (papillary, chromophobe)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">PAX8, PAX2, AMACR (racemase), CD10, KIT</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 16; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"142\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Salivary gland</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">GATA3, S100, SOX10, GCDFP-15 (BRST2), AR, ERBB2 (HER2)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 17; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"142\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.45pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Bladder</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">GATA3, p63</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 18; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"142\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>CK7+/CK20+</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 19; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"142\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.45pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Bladder</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">GATA3, p63</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 20; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"142\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Upper gastrointestinal&nbsp;/pancreatobiliary</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">CDX2, CK19, SMAD4, ARID1A, BAP1</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 21; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"142\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.45pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Rectum (be aware)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">CDX2, SATB2</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 22; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"142\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>CK7&minus;/CK20+</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 23; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"142\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.45pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Colorectal, upper gastrointestinal (be aware)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">CDX2, SATB2</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 24; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"142\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Merkel cell carcinoma</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">INSM1, synaptophysin</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 25; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"142\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>CK7&minus;/CK20&minus;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.45pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 26; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.35pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"142\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Renal cell carcinoma</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">PAX8, PAX2, AMACR (racemase), RCCm, CD10</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 27; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.35pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"142\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 298.45pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"398\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Hepatocellular carcinoma</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 2